# 统一换行纪律：全新 clone 与 CI 必须拿到与开发机逐字节一致的文本
# （Windows 开发机 core.autocrlf=true 会把检出内容重写为 CRLF，字节冻结基准与 EOL 守门测试会因此挂）
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.xlsx binary
*.xls binary
*.docx binary
*.pdf binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.pyd binary
*.zip binary
*.ttf binary
*.sqlite binary
*.db binary
